  data: {
    LLM: "Identify the 'Machine': If you or your partner holds all three Criticals, you have an unbreakable hand. Signal your partner immediately to ensure they don't 'offer' a raise until you are ready.\n\nThe Signaling (Deuten): Use standard signals: Tongue to the side for the Maxl (KH), wink for the Belli (7B), and shoulder-shrug for the Spitz (7A). Coordination is key to winning without wasting high trumps on the same trick.\n\nBluffing the Raise: If you win the first two tricks and have nothing left, 'offer' to raise the points to 3. If the opponents haven't coordinated their signals well, they may fold, giving you the win despite a weak hand.",
    Player: "Identify the 'Machine': If you or your partner holds all three Criticals, you have an unbreakable hand. Signal your partner immediately to ensure they don't 'offer' a raise until you are ready.\n\nThe Signaling (Deuten): Use standard signals: Tongue to the side for the Maxl (KH), wink for the Belli (7B), and shoulder-shrug for the Spitz (7A). Coordination is key to winning without wasting high trumps on the same trick.\n\nBluffing the Raise: If you win the first two tricks and have nothing left, 'offer' to raise the points to 3. If the opponents haven't coordinated their signals well, they may fold, giving you the win despite a weak hand.",
